{"id":"legacy-recipe-3b2b038a-d096-4f7d-a405-001fb1493795","version":1,"category":"roof-outdoor","when":"Existing roof recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Ventilated Mono-Pitch Roof 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"cover primary living pavilion\",\"target\":\"main-house\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"extend low eave over outdoor seating\",\"target\":\"covered-terrace\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"direct visible downpipes and overflow away from entries\",\"target\":\"rain-garden\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"orient high clerestory edge toward pool and ocean views\",\"target\":\"pool\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"avoid low eaves over vehicle turning paths\",\"target\":\"driveway\"}]","placement":"Slope the roof away from prevailing ocean winds where site geometry allows. Lift the high edge toward the principal view without exposing occupied rooms to direct afternoon sun. Use a continuous ventilated ridge and insect-screened clerestory gap. Extend deep eaves over glazed walls and covered outdoor living zones. Collect roof runoff in concealed gutters and route overflow to planted drainage. Keep the roof silhouette as one disciplined plane with restrained structural expression.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"roofPitch\",\"max\":20,\"min\":5,\"unit\":\"deg\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"eaveDepth\",\"max\":3.5,\"min\":1.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.4},{\"key\":\"ridgeVentHeight\",\"max\":0.9,\"min\":0.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.45},{\"key\":\"roofProjectionLength\",\"max\":28,\"min\":7,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":14},{\"key\":\"clerestoryBandHeight\",\"max\":1.5,\"min\":0.35,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.8},{\"key\":\"rainwaterTankCapacity\",\"max\":30000,\"min\":3000,\"unit\":\"L\",\"value\":12000},{\"key\":\"roofFinish\",\"value\":\"standing-seam-metal\",\"options\":[\"standing-seam-metal\",\"light-toned-tile\",\"composite-shingle\"]},{\"